Protocol facts (feature codes, byte layouts, GATT UUIDs) for Casio watches
were derived from the open-source Gadgetbridge project and dakk's
casio-gshock-bt-proto documentation. Only the protocol facts were used; the
code here is an independent reimplementation. This project is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Casio. "G-SHOCK" is a trademark of Casio.

